# [sr-gx 2026-09-04] Build outputs of gamecube/recomp/sr/build_image.sh under SR_OUT.
# Same three reasons as gamecube/recomp/sr_image/.gitignore — read that file for the
# full rationale; the short version is that `*.wasm` is LFS-routed, GitHub Pages does
# NOT resolve LFS pointers (it served 133-byte pointers as a Dreamcast disc and the
# game crashed at boot, commit ffa15b3), sr_gen.c is 33 MB of generated C that is
# regenerable in one command, and sab_main.dol / sab_fst.bin are retail disc content.
#
# This directory exists because two -O2 compiles of the 33 MB translation unit cannot
# share a box with 16 GB of RAM, so a second output tree keeps a relink here from
# tearing the .js/.wasm pair a sibling agent's probe is reading.
sab_image.mjs
sab_image.wasm
sab_main.dol
sab_fst.bin
sr_gen.c
sr_dispatch.c
skiplist.json
